    <Label Name="Label1" Style="12" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="Multiplication of complex numbers" X="-8.14061684156321" Y="4.9887154446486" />
    <Label Name="Label2" Style="13" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="We can treat our euclidean plane as a complex number field.\nThen two-dimensional vectors become complex numbers, \nvector addition and subtraction - equivalent to complex operations.\nHow is the product-vector of the two complex numbers situated?" X="-7.99254307579426" Y="4.48534415269158" />
    <Label Name="Label3" Style="13" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="Explore, what is the square of a complex number\nin vector interpretation? When the product of two\ncomplex numbers is real? When it is equal to (0;-1)?" X="-0.663770187248333" Y="-2.57567681374854" />
    <Label Name="Label4" Style="13" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="Let us have 2 complex numbers:\nA(a;b) и B(c,d).\nTheir product is calculated using formula:\nA*B = (ac-bd) + i(bc+ad)\n\nIn our case A([A.X];[A.Y]) and B([B.X];[B.Y]), С = A * B.\nDe Moivre's formulas state that:\n\nArg(AB)=Arg(A)+Arg(B)\n|AB|=|A|*|B|" X="-8.03790990808166" Y="1.54558289520242">
      <Dependency Name="A" />
      <Dependency Name="A" />
      <Dependency Name="B" />
      <Dependency Name="B" />
    </Label>
    <Label Name="Label5" Style="14" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="Exploration:" X="-8.25647466422992" Y="2.22205005342506" />
    <Label Name="Label6" Style="13" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="Arg(A) + Arg(B) = [deg(ang(b,o,x)+ang(a,o,x))]°\nArg(C) = [deg(ang(c,o,x))]°\n\n|A|*|B| = [AO*OB]\n|C| = [OC]" X="4.05785418754311" Y="4.50782405268956">
      <Dependency Name="B" />
      <Dependency Name="O" />
      <Dependency Name="X" />
      <Dependency Name="A" />
      <Dependency Name="O" />
      <Dependency Name="X" />
      <Dependency Name="C" />
      <Dependency Name="O" />
      <Dependency Name="X" />
      <Dependency Name="A" />
      <Dependency Name="O" />
      <Dependency Name="O" />
      <Dependency Name="B" />
      <Dependency Name="O" />
      <Dependency Name="C" />
    </Label>
    <Label Name="Label7" Style="14" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="Results:" X="3.63071164148594" Y="4.99791311718882" />
    <Label Name="Label8" Style="14" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="Further research:" X="-1.0575198550852" Y="-1.90361563488326" />
